            <div xml:id="d432">

                <pb facs="0731" n="599" xml:id="pg599"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/7176: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-03-13T16:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 13,
                                1926—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received March 13—9:12
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>125. My number 123, March 12, 7 p.m. Naval commanders at Tientsin have found it
                    necessary because of practical difficulties to request delay of one day in
                    making the contemplated notification to Chinese military and naval authorities.
                    I have approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
